Test pages and images, saved from The Millionth (the author's news site, from the
retro-homepage project) as it rendered them:

front.html, story.html, weather.html: its pages, with lorem ipsum in place of the
news text.
masthead-s.gif: its masthead. partly.gif: its "partly cloudy" weather icon. Both
drawn for The Millionth.
rainier-t.jpg: its thumbnail of the National Park Service's Mount Rainier from
Paradise webcam (https://www.nps.gov/webcams-mora/mountain.jpg). Public domain:
a work of the US government.
